</section>

<!-- IMPORTANCE -->
<section id="importance">
    <h2>Why Are Greenhouse Gases Important?</h2>
    <div class="flex-row">
        <div class="flex-col">
            <p>
                Greenhouse gases are essential for maintaining a stable climate. Without them, Earth would be 
                around <strong>33°C colder</strong> and unable to support most life.
            </p>
            <p><strong>They help by:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Keeping Earth warm enough for liquid water.</li>
                <li>Maintaining stable climates and ecosystems.</li>
                <li>Allowing agriculture and biodiversity to exist.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-col">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSrDOR6ZeFSK-An0Ha9Lw6WXHyRx6fujqvAbg&s"
                 alt="Importance of greenhouse gases"
                 style="width:100%; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- HUMAN IMPACT -->
<section id="human">
    <h2>How Human Activities Increase Greenhouse Gases</h2>
    <div class="flex-row">
        <div class="flex-col">
            <p>
                Since the Industrial Revolution, humans have increased greenhouse gas levels dramatically. 
                This strengthens the natural greenhouse effect, causing the <strong>enhanced greenhouse effect</strong> 
                and global warming.
            </p>
            <p><strong>Main human sources:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Burning fossil fuels:</strong> Cars, power stations, heating → CO₂.</li>
                <li><strong>Deforestation:</strong> Fewer trees to absorb CO₂.</li>
                <li><strong>Agriculture:</strong> Cattle produce methane; fertilisers release N₂O.</li>
                <li><strong>Landfill sites:</strong> Decomposing waste releases methane.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-col">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcR6UCMwDxugKNFbBReiziqlsZ8LPpxD3U0mNg&s"
