                 style="width:100%; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- GREENHOUSE EFFECT -->
<section id="effect">
    <h2>The Greenhouse Effect (GCSE Explanation)</h2>
    <div class="flex-row">
        <div class="flex-col">
            <p>
                The greenhouse effect is a natural process. The Sun emits short‑wave radiation that passes through 
                the atmosphere and warms the Earth. The Earth then emits long‑wave infrared radiation. Greenhouse 
                gases absorb this heat and re‑radiate it in all directions.
            </p>
            <p>
                Human activity increases greenhouse gas levels, making the insulating layer thicker. This is the 
                <strong>enhanced greenhouse effect</strong>, which leads to global warming.
            </p>
        </div>
