<!-- CONSEQUENCES -->
<section id="consequences">
    <h2>Consequences of Global Warming</h2>
    <div class="flex-row">
        <div class="flex-col">
            <p><strong>Global warming causes major environmental and biological impacts:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Rising sea levels:</strong> Melting ice caps + thermal expansion.</li>
                <li><strong>Loss of biodiversity:</strong> Species unable to adapt quickly enough.</li>
                <li><strong>More extreme weather:</strong> Storms, droughts, heatwaves.</li>
                <li><strong>Changes in migration patterns:</strong> Birds, insects, and fish shift ranges.</li>
                <li><strong>Coral bleaching:</strong> Warmer oceans stress coral reefs.</li>
                <li><strong>Food insecurity:</strong> Crop failures in some regions.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
